# Dockerfile-scoped ignore (BuildKit uses <dockerfile>.dockerignore) for the
# region-pages monorepo build. Context is the monorepo root; we only need source
# + workspace manifests (turbo prune installs deps fresh), so exclude all
# node_modules / build artifacts / secrets to keep the context small.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/.expo
**/.output
**/.vercel
.git
**/coverage
**/.cache
**/dist
**/.DS_Store
# secrets / local env (never ship these in the context)
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
!**/.env.*.sample
.secrets
**/terraform.tfvars
**/*.tfstate*
**/.terraform
